# Fleet plan records — local working notes, not part of the product
# Fleet working files stay out of the repository -- except the environment file.
# `.fleet/*` rather than `.fleet/`: git never descends into an excluded directory,
# so a negation under `.fleet/` would never be reached.
.fleet/*
!.fleet/environment.md

